<title>USA: Alexandria over-allotment exercised.</title>
<headline>Alexandria over-allotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alexandria Real Estate Equities Inc said underwriters for the company's initial public offering have exercised the full over-allotment option to buy an additional 1,012,500 shares from the company at the initial public offering price.</p>
<p>It said closing of the purchase and the sale of the over-allotment shares is scheduled to close on June 26.</p>
</text>
